Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:29:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(process): require independent review before merge
 planning

Collect paginated review evidence and reject author-only markers before
offering PRs. Keep shared-account independent reviews with provenance and
plan only explicitly retained PR numbers. Pin the skill instructions.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1828
